{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793742330425,"sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","part":{"partID":"prt_1a35fd9e7001u7EiDFCMF19MAj","sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","messageID":"msg_1a35fd1cf001zydmujNPANm6P5","type":"tool","id":"call_01_6u8pw0qkor681aatkt3a90e9","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/deep-research-config.json; echo \"---FANOUT---\"; cat specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/fanout.json"},"output":"{\n  \"researchTopic\": \"Audit every reference and asset under .skilled/skills/sk-code/ (hub shared/, sk-code-ci, sk-code-frontend, sk-code-quality, sk-code-review, sk-code-skilled, plus their SKILL.md and ROUTER.md) for readability, structure, layout and the sort order of sections and items inside each file, against the sk-doc reference and asset templates (.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md and skill-asset-template.md). Find rendering defects (consecutive bold-label lines that Markdown joins into one paragraph, a text line directly above --- that renders as a setext heading, 'OVERVIEW AND <topic>' sections with no overview, duplicated or misplaced content, bare URLs, items ordered by authoring history instead of reader task). Then trace why .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill (templates, authoring guidance, scripts) and .skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py let such defects pass (the pre-fix web-cascade-and-selectors.md at commit cd00629166 validated VALID with 0 issues), and propose template, guidance and validator changes that would catch each defect class, saying which are mechanically checkable. Read-only: write only under the research artifact directory. Cite file:line for every finding.\",\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 15,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n  \"antiConvergence\": {\n    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n    \"divergent\": {}\n  },\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": true\n  },\n  \"fanout\": {\n    \"concurrency\": 2,\n    \"executors\": [\n      {\n        \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n        \"model\": \"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\n        \"reasoningEffort\": \"max\",\n        \"label\": \"deepseek\",\n        \"iterations\": 8,\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 2400\n      },\n      {\n        \"kind\": \"cli-codex\",\n        \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n        \"reasoningEffort\": \"xhigh\",\n        \"serviceTier\": \"standard\",\n        \"label\": \"luna\",\n        \"iterations\": 7,\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 2400\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}---FANOUT---\n{\"concurrency\":2,\"executors\":[{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"max\",\"label\":\"deepseek\",\"iterations\":8,\"timeoutSeconds\":2400},{\"kind\":\"cli-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"xhigh\",\"serviceTier\":\"standard\",\"label\":\"luna\",\"iterations\":7,\"timeoutSeconds\":2400}]}\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"researchTopic\": \"Audit every reference and asset under .skilled/skills/sk-code/ (hub shared/, sk-code-ci, sk-code-frontend, sk-code-quality, sk-code-review, sk-code-skilled, plus their SKILL.md and ROUTER.md) for readability, structure, layout and the sort order of sections and items inside each file, against the sk-doc reference and asset templates (.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md and skill-asset-template.md). Find rendering defects (consecutive bold-label lines that Markdown joins into one paragraph, a text line directly above --- that renders as a setext heading, 'OVERVIEW AND <topic>' sections with no overview, duplicated or misplaced content, bare URLs, items ordered by authoring history instead of reader task). Then trace why .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill (templates, authoring guidance, scripts) and .skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py let such defects pass (the pre-fix web-cascade-and-selectors.md at commit cd00629166 validated VALID with 0 issues), and propose template, guidance and validator changes that would catch each defect class, saying which are mechanically checkable. Read-only: write only under the research artifact directory. Cite file:line for every finding.\",\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 15,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n  \"antiConvergence\": {\n    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n    \"divergent\": {}\n  },\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": true\n  },\n  \"fanout\": {\n    \"concurrency\": 2,\n    \"executors\": [\n      {\n        \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n        \"model\": \"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\n        \"reasoningEffort\": \"max\",\n        \"label\": \"deepseek\",\n        \"iterations\": 8,\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 2400\n      },\n      {\n        \"kind\": \"cli-codex\",\n        \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\n        \"reasoningEffort\": \"xhigh\",\n        \"serviceTier\": \"standard\",\n        \"label\": \"luna\",\n        \"iterations\": 7,\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 2400\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}---FANOUT---\n{\"concurrency\":2,\"executors\":[{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"max\",\"label\":\"deepseek\",\"iterations\":8,\"timeoutSeconds\":2400},{\"kind\":\"cli-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"xhigh\",\"serviceTier\":\"standard\",\"label\":\"luna\",\"iterations\":7,\"timeoutSeconds\":2400}]}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cat specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/deep-research-config.json; echo \\\"---FANOUT---\\\"; cat specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/fanout.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1793742330343,"end":1793742330425}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793742330443,"sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","part":{"partID":"prt_1a35fd9cb001MLrUiCLrMBp2lg","sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","messageID":"msg_1a35fd1cf001zydmujNPANm6P5","type":"tool","id":"call_00_kiqzc7j2ddh5fxytwu0q1qgy","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"step_create_state_log\\|step_reduce_state\\|step_init\\|step_synthesis\\|append-mode-event\\|reduce-state\\|research.md\\|iterations/\\|deltas/\\|findings-registry\\|deep-research-strategy\\|deep-research-dashboard\\|config.json\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head -80"},"output":"84:    config: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-config.json\n85:    strategy: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md\n92:  agent_file: \".skilled/agents/deep-research.md\"\n108:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n150:  config: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-config.json\"\n153:  strategy: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n154:  registry: \"{artifact_dir}/findings-registry.json\"\n155:  dashboard: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md\"\n161:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n168:  delta_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas/iter-{NNN}.jsonl\"\n169:  research_output: \"{artifact_dir}/research.md\"\n229:            --fanout-config-json '{config.fanout_json}' \\\n271:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/config.json\"\n356:        action: \"Create deep-research-config.json from template\"\n357:        template: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-config.json\n372:          # Honor the parsed --no-resource-map flag from deep-research.md:73 (default true; false when flag is set).\n387:      step_create_state_log:\n393:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n394:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n446:        template: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md\n517:                    content: \"Add a bounded note that deep-research is active for this topic and that research/research.md remains canonical.\"\n584:      step_init_complete:\n628:          - resource_map_present: \"Extract boolean from deep-research-config.json, default false\"\n634:          - nextRunAt: \"Extract nullable nextRunAt from deep-research-config.json, default null\"\n635:          - remainingDelayMs: \"Extract nullable remainingDelayMs from deep-research-config.json, default null\"\n636:          - min_iterations_present: \"Boolean true when deep-research-config.json has a numeric minIterations field\"\n638:          - min_iterations_raw: \"Extract numeric minIterations from deep-research-config.json when present, default 0\"\n643:          - stop_policy: \"Extract stopPolicy from deep-research-config.json, default 'convergence'. Valid values: convergence, max-iterations.\"\n659:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n660:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1047:                  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n1108:          message: 'All next-focus, recovery, and ideas candidates match active rejected patterns. Remove or reset the rejected pattern, or provide a new focus. In a ledger-backed run (a deep-research-ledger/frames folder beside the state log) the next projection replaces a hand-edited state log, so record the removal or reset through the append gateway: write one row to a file, either {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_removed\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"pattern\":\"<rejected text>\",\"category\":\"<its category>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now, e.g. 2026-05-24T00:00:00Z>\"} or {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1796:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the research yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1838:            - \"delta_file_missing — per-iteration deltas/iter-NNN.jsonl not written\"\n1849:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1850:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1902:      step_reduce_state:\n1904:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n2014:        source_note: \"step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved.\"\n2030:          - registry_updated: \"Reducer refreshed findings-registry.json\"\n2124:        template: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md\n2143:    purpose: Compile all iteration findings into final research/research.md\n2165:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n2185:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/iterations/iteration-*.md\"\n2194:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only\"\n2198:            - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deltas/iter-*.jsonl\"\n2200:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map\"\n2209:        action: \"Compile or finalize research/research.md\"\n2211:          If research/research.md exists (progressive synthesis was active):\n2212:            1. Read current research/research.md\n2220:          If research/research.md does not exist:\n2221:            1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n2244:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2245:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2288:        append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"spec_mutation\",\"event\":\"spec_mutation\",\"phase\":\"post-synthesis\",\"anchors_touched\":[\"<chosen host anchor>\"],\"diff_summary\":\"Replaced generated deep-research findings fence from research/research.md.\",\"generatedFence\":\"deep-research/spec-findings\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n2388:        note: \"Skill-owned contract fix (028): without this stage step, operators who do `git add research-report.md` lose the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, etc.). Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the audit trail intact. Operators retain commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` to unstage anything before commit. Failure is non-fatal: log warning and continue. The exclude pathspecs keep the live lock file, the pause and run-now sentinels, and the legacy projection watermark directory out of the index; locks-and-fencing-v1, ledgers, deltas, iterations and the state log stay staged.\"\n2408:            \"sessionSummary\": \"Deep research completed; see research/research.md for synthesized findings.\",\n2440:        - research/research.md (compiled from {iteration_count} iterations)\n2442:        - State files: config.json, state.jsonl, strategy.md, findings-registry.json, dashboard.md\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"84:    config: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-config.json\n85:    strategy: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md\n92:  agent_file: \".skilled/agents/deep-research.md\"\n108:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n150:  config: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-config.json\"\n153:  strategy: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n154:  registry: \"{artifact_dir}/findings-registry.json\"\n155:  dashboard: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md\"\n161:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n168:  delta_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas/iter-{NNN}.jsonl\"\n169:  research_output: \"{artifact_dir}/research.md\"\n229:            --fanout-config-json '{config.fanout_json}' \\\n271:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/config.json\"\n356:        action: \"Create deep-research-config.json from template\"\n357:        template: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-config.json\n372:          # Honor the parsed --no-resource-map flag from deep-research.md:73 (default true; false when flag is set).\n387:      step_create_state_log:\n393:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n394:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scri