_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1796:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the research yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1838:            - \"delta_file_missing — per-iteration deltas/iter-NNN.jsonl not written\"\n1849:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1850:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1902:      step_reduce_state:\n1904:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n2014:        source_note: \"step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved.\"\n2030:          - registry_updated: \"Reducer refreshed findings-registry.json\"\n2124:        template: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md\n2143:    purpose: Compile all iteration findings into final research/research.md\n2165:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n2185:          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/iterations/iteration-*.md\"\n2194:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only\"\n2198:            - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deltas/iter-*.jsonl\"\n2200:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map\"\n2209:        action: \"Compile or finalize research/research.md\"\n2211:          If research/research.md exists (progressive synthesis was active):\n2212:            1. Read current research/research.md\n2220:          If research/research.md does not exist:\n2221:            1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n2244:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2245:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2288:        append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"spec_mutation\",\"event\":\"spec_mutation\",\"phase\":\"post-synthesis\",\"anchors_touched\":[\"<chosen host anchor>\"],\"diff_summary\":\"Replaced generated deep-research findings fence from research/research.md.\",\"generatedFence\":\"deep-research/spec-findings\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n2388:        note: \"Skill-owned contract fix (028): without this stage step, operators who do `git add research-report.md` lose the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, etc.). Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the audit trail intact. Operators retain commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` to unstage anything before commit. Failure is non-fatal: log warning and continue. The exclude pathspecs keep the live lock file, the pause and run-now sentinels, and the legacy projection watermark directory out of the index; locks-and-fencing-v1, ledgers, deltas, iterations and the state log stay staged.\"\n2408:            \"sessionSummary\": \"Deep research completed; see research/research.md for synthesized findings.\",\n2440:        - research/research.md (compiled from {iteration_count} iterations)\n2442:        - State files: config.json, state.jsonl, strategy.md, findings-registry.json, dashboard.md\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|step_init\\\\|step_synthesis\\\\|append-mode-event\\\\|reduce-state\\\\|research.md\\\\|iterations/\\\\|deltas/\\\\|findings-registry\\\\|deep-research-strategy\\\\|deep-research-dashboard\\\\|config.json\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head -80\"}"},"time":{"start":1793742330315,"end":1793742330443}}}}
