ere.\n===SECTION NUM===\n65:- ✅ Numbered H2 sections (ALL CAPS)\n517:That heading is the one every reader parses. Its section number is optional, so `## MACHINE ROUTER` and `## 9. MACHINE ROUTER` both count, and the check ignores the number.\n914:□ Numbered H2 sections for the body (1. WHEN TO USE, 2. SMART ROUTING, etc.)\n964:| **H2 Format**         | Number + ALL CAPS          | ✅ `## 1. WHEN TO USE`                                                                            |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n -i 'intro\\\\|1-2 sentence\\\\|sentence' .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md | head -20; echo \\\"===SECTION NUM===\\\"; grep -n -i 'number\\\\|2b\\\\|sequential' .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1793742608004,"end":1793742608113}}}}
