`srcset`). Chrome 38 / Firefox 38 / Safari 10.1.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"19:## 1. OVERVIEW AND CASCADE AND SPECIFICITY\n27:**Support.** Judgment, no version gate.\n36:**Support.** Baseline widely available since 2024-09-14 (web-features `cascade-layers`). Chrome 99 / Firefox 97 / Safari 15.4.\n45:**Support.** Judgment, no version gate.\n58:**Support.** Baseline widely available since 2023-07-21 (web-features `is`). Chrome 88 / Firefox 82 / Safari 14.\n59:**Support.** Baseline widely available since 2023-07-21 (web-features `where`). Chrome 88 / Firefox 82 / Safari 14.\n68:**Support.** Baseline widely available since 2026-06-19 (web-features `has`). Chrome 105 / Firefox 121 / Safari 15.4.\n81:**Support.** Baseline widely available since 2026-06-11 (web-features `nesting`). Chrome 120 / Firefox 117 / Safari 17.2.\n90:**Support.** Baseline newly available since 2026-03-24 (web-features `scope`). Chrome 143 / Firefox 146 / Safari 26.4.\n99:**Support.** Baseline newly available since 2024-07-09 (web-features `registered-custom-properties`). Chrome 85 / Firefox 128 / Safari 16.4.\n108:**Support.** Judgment, no version gate.\n===CURRENT DUP SUPPORT===\n130:- **Support:** Baseline widely available since 2019-09-27 (web-features `srcset`). Chrome 38 / Firefox 38 / Safari 10.1. Baseline widely available since 2019-09-27 (web-features `srcset`). Chrome 38 / Firefox 38 / Safari 10.1.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n 'OVERVIEW\\\\|^\\\\*\\\\*Support' specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/.executor-state/prefix-web-cascade.md | head -14; echo \\\"===CURRENT DUP SUPPORT===\\\"; grep -n 'Baseline widely available since 2019-09-27' .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md\"}"},"time":{"start":179