acent bold-label lines per rule (23-28), which Markdown joins into one paragraph and erases the label structure.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:23 (at cd00629166)\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Pre-fix web-cascade-and-selectors.md opens with OVERVIEW AND CASCADE AND SPECIFICITY (19) and jumps straight to CS1, so the overview section contains no overview.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:19 (at cd00629166)\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Pre-fix web-cascade-and-selectors.md has nine bare See-also URLs (28,37,46,60,69,82,91,100,109) and a duplicated Support line at 58-59.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:28 (at cd00629166)\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:58 (at cd00629166)\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Current HEAD web-cascade-and-selectors.md shows the intended repair: label lines became bullet items and bare URLs became named links (41-48).\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:41\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:48\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"web-performance-and-loading.md orders rules by authoring history: P10 at 111 precedes P8 at 124 and P9 at 133.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:111\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:124\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:133\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"web-performance-and-loading.md P8 repeats the entire srcset support sentence twice inside one bullet at line 130, the duplicate-label class surviving at HEAD.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:130\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"web-internationalization.md jumps from I7 at 105 to I9 at 118 with no I8, leaving a numbering gap that signals a lost rule.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-internationalization.md:105\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-internationalization.md:118\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"figma-to-code.md opens its OVERVIEW with Core Principle (21) before Purpose (25) and When to Use (29), while every sibling web reference starts with Purpose, When to Use, Boundaries.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/figma-to-code.md:21\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/figma-to-code.md:25\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:21\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793742686148,"end":1793742686404}}}}
