nce of an ephemeral tracking artifact in a comment. Keep the durable WHY; drop the perishable label. This is the canonical statement of the floor rule `floor.ephemeral-pointers`, and surface guides point here rather than restating it. The comment-hygiene checker enforces i\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"awk 'length>400 {print NR\\\": \\\"length}' .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/references/code-style-guide.md; echo \\\"===116===\\\"; sed -n '114,120p' .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/references/code-style-guide.md | cut -c1-300\"}"},"time":{"start":1793742720183,"end":1793742720225}}}}
