{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793742777358,"sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","part":{"partID":"prt_1a366abe5001QE9nB3n3cpg87d","sessionID":"ses_e5ca055c6ffeOZO66b0AKuGGW6","messageID":"msg_1a366969f001qGPSUTgxPk64sy","type":"tool","id":"call_01_tkp5pobtl5zfc76hwm71eiin","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"for f in .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/*.md; do echo \"=== $f\"; grep -n '^#\\{1,3\\} ' \"$f\" | head -14; done"},"output":"=== .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/code-quality-checklist.md\n15:# Code Quality Checklist\n21:## 1. OVERVIEW\n23:### Purpose\n27:### Usage\n31:### Core Principle\n35:### Rule Ids\n41:## 2. ERROR HANDLING\n58:## 3. PERFORMANCE AND SCALING\n75:## 4. BOUNDARY CONDITIONS\n96:## 5. DATA FLOW AND CONTRACT SAFETY\n120:## 6. MAINTAINABILITY SIGNALS\n143:## 7. KISS / DRY ENFORCEMENT\n147:### KISS Checks\n156:### DRY Checks\n=== .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/fix-completeness-checklist.md\n15:# Fix Completeness Checklist\n19:## 1. OVERVIEW\n21:### Purpose\n25:### Usage\n31:## 2. CLASSIFICATION\n44:### Instance-Only Opt-Out\n57:## 3. REQUIRED INVENTORIES\n98:## 4. COMPLETION OUTPUT\n113:## 5. RELATED RESOURCES\n=== .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/removal-plan.md\n14:# Removal and Iteration Plan\n20:## 1. OVERVIEW\n22:### Purpose\n26:### Usage\n30:### Core Principle\n34:### Priority Model\n44:## 2. SAFE TO REMOVE NOW\n66:## 3. DEFERRED REMOVAL PLAN\n88:## 4. REVIEWER CHECKLIST\n100:## 5. RELATED RESOURCES\n=== .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/security-checklist.md\n16:# Security and Reliability Checklist\n22:## 1. OVERVIEW\n24:### Purpose\n28:### Usage\n32:### Core Principle\n36:### Rule Ids\n40:### Web Items\n46:## 2. INPUT/OUTPUT SAFETY\n63:## 3. AUTHENTICATION AND AUTHORIZATION\n78:## 4. SECRETS AND PRIVACY\n96:## 5. RUNTIME RELIABILITY\n112:## 6. CONCURRENCY AND RACE CONDITIONS\n140:## 7. RATE LIMITING AND ABUSE PREVENTION\n155:## 8. CONT