\":\\\"All five findings are new skilled-family evidence: the 14-file boilerplate set, the repeated 2b numbering, the welded section heading, the related placement and the repeated evidence label.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which sk-code-skilled references and checklist assets carry the enumerated defects, and is the divergence systematic across a file family?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Repeated exemption-tier subheads as duplication\\\",\\\"Same evidence path across two rules as duplication\\\",\\\"Checklist assets as boilerplate\\\"],\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shell/style-guide/overview-structure-and-naming.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shared/alignment-verification-automation.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/SKILL.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/rust-checklist\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-03T22:20:00Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":360000,\\\"executor\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"cli-opencode\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\\\",\\\"reasoningEffort\\\":\\\"max\\\"}};\\nconst findings=[\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Fourteen rust split references repeat the content-free purpose sentence and the same three When-to-Use bullets; only overview-and-file-header.md states a specific purpose and specific triggers.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust/style-guide/naming-conventions.md:22\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust/style-guide/formatting-and-imports.md:22\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust/style-guide/toolchain-and-project-structure.md:22\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust/style-guide/overview-and-file-header.md:22\\\"]},\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"sk-code-skilled SKILL.md repeats the 2b section numbering (SMART ROUTING at 110 between sections 2 and 3), the same pattern as sk-code-ci.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/SKILL.md:110\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/SKILL.md:37\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/SKILL.md:120\\\"]},\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"sk-code-skilled SKILL.md section 4 heading welds three concepts into one H2: ASSETS AND OTHER SURFACE AREAS - ON-DEMAND at line 148.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/SKILL.md:148\\\"]},\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"alignment-verification-automation.md places RELATED RESOURCES at 139 and then continues with section 6 at 148, so the related section interrupts the authority contract instead of closing the file.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shared/alignment-verification-automation.md:139\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shared/alignment-verification-automation.md:148\\\"]},\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"shell style guide renders two consecutive Evidence label paragraphs for one rule at lines 170 and 172 without merging them.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shell/style-guide/overview-structure-and-naming.md:170\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shell/style-guide/overview-structure-and-naming.md:172\\\"]}\\n];\\nfs.writeFileSync(p,[row,...findings].map(JSON.stringify).join(\\\"\\\\n\\\")+\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nconst lines=fs.readFileSync(p,\\\"utf8\\\").trim().split(\\\"\\\\