-cascade file and four current defective files each return valid true with total_issues 0 under --type reference, confirming the validator gap by execution.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2008\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2045\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"label\":\"Required sections are matched by heading name and substring only, so OVERVIEW AND CASCADE AND SPECIFICITY satisfies requiredSections overview even with no overview prose.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:837\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:909\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/assets/template-rules.json:321\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"label\":\"The H2 checker matches only numbered digits-dot headings, so 2b and unnumbered H2s are invisible, and non-sequential numbers are warnings rather than blocking errors.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:736\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:761\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"label\":\"recommendedSections is only read inside the router branch, so related_resources is never required or ordered for references; the rule data also contradicts the asset template must-be-last clause.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:928\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/assets/template-rules.json:323\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-asset-template.md:166\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"label\":\"The validator has no content-level checks for adjacent bold labels, setext hazards, bare URLs, duplicated content, intro length or item order; orchestration runs only TOC, H2, structure, required sections and frontmatter.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2009\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2016\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2028\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"label\":\"The divider rule requires a horizontal rule above numbered H2s but never a blank line above that rule, so the setext-producing layout passes; the template duplicated when-to-create guidance compounds the gap.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:676\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:690\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:86\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:182\"]}\n","path":"specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.9,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Validator and guidance gap trace\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":6,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"