nsecutive non-list bold-label lines outside fences; the prototype found zero current hits and nine pre-fix blocks, so precision is high.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2008\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:130\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-002\",\"label\":\"Add a blocking render_setext_hazard check for a non-blank non-heading line directly above a thematic break; one-line lookbehind, zero current hits, the pre-fix layout as control.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:676\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:77\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-003\",\"label\":\"Add a blocking render_overview_empty check: an OVERVIEW heading needs 40+ characters of prose or a Purpose/When-to-Use subsection before the next section; OVERVIEW AND headings are flagged outright.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/references/runner-contract.md:20\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/assets/template-rules.json:321\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-004\",\"label\":\"Add render_related_last for references and assets, but first reconcile the asset template must-be-last clause with the reference template silence and the rule data recommended-only status.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-asset-template.md:166\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/assets/template-rules.json:323\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md:218\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-005\",\"label\":\"Add a warning-level render_bare_url check for unfenced http(s) URLs not inside a markdown link or autolink; zero current hits and nine in the pre-fix control.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:58\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-cascade-and-selectors.md:28 (at cd00629166)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-006\",\"label\":\"Add a warning-level duplicate-block check for identical paragraphs or repeated bold labels; semantic boilerplate across files needs a batch heuristic plus editorial review, not a blocking gate.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:130\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/shell/style-guide/overview-structure-and-naming.md:170\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/rust/style-guide/naming-conventions.md:22\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-007\",\"label\":\"Extend the H2 regex to accept and reject letter suffixes, make non-sequential numbers blocking, and add a warning rule-id monotonic check; this catches 2b, pr-state numbering, P10 before P8 and the I8 gap.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:736\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-frontend/references/web-performance-and-loading.md:111\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/references/pr-state-dedup.md:21\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-008\",\"label\":\"Template changes are the precondition: merge the duplicated when-to-create guidance, add bold-label and thematic-break blank-line rules, forbid OVERVIEW AND, add related-last to the reference template and reject letter suffixes in the skill template.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:36\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md:182\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md:65\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-009\",\"label\":\"Semantic reader-task order, misplaced content beyond heading position and overview quality stay human review items; the validator can only surface proxies.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py:2009\"]}\n","path":"specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-code/018-frontend-upstream-proposals/010-reference-readability-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793742315296-80sid6\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.85,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Template, guidance and validator changes\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All nine findings are new remediation proposals, each mapped to the validator function and defect class it would catch, with a checkability level and precision estimate.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which template, guidance and validator changes would catch each defect class, and which are mechanically checkable at what precision?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Rejecting every bold-label paragraph\\\",\\\"Rejecting every raw URL\\\",\\\"A blocking cross-file purpose-sentence rule\\\"],\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/vali